    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald O'Donovan are delighted to present to the market this lovely two bedroom town house in a brilliant location in Ballycasey. This spacious two bed has generous accommodation including a small utility room and an en suite from the master bedroom plus a large open plan kitchen/living/dining room. \n\nThe house would make an ideal family home and it would also be ideal for people looking to downsize. It is in a great location that offers easy access to the M18 to Limerick, Ennis and Galway and it also offers very easy access to East Park and Smithstown.\n\nThe property also boasts a large attic space which has great potential to be converted into an additional bedroom(subjected to planning) or a home office. \n\nViewing comes highly recommended without delay."
      },
